GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 22(1): the pension equivalent` `the amount of the full monthly pension payable for the month under section 7 that has not been increased under subsection 7(5)` MEANS
    `the amount of the full monthly pension payable for the month under section 7 that has not been increased under subsection 7(5)`

