`s 22(3)(b): the amount of the allowance` `the pension equivalent in respect of the month` `the supplement equivalent in respect of the month` `the spouse's or common-law partner's special qualifying factor for the month` `the monthly joint income of the pensioner and the spouse or common-law partner in the current payment period` MEANS
