-- (4.1) "The amount of the supplement equivalent for the survivor is (a) four hundred and fifty-four dollars and nine
-- cents, for any month in the payment quarter commencing on April 1, 2005; (b) the amount of the supplement equivalent
-- for the survivor that would otherwise be payable plus eighteen dollars, for any month in the payment quarter
-- commencing on January 1, 2006; and (c) [the same] for any month in the payment quarter commencing on January 1, 2007."
